  "outstanding": [
    "The contour displacement, Dirichlet zero density over characters and repulsion are separate arguments. The strip estimate used for the weighted zero count passes through the smoothed-character list. The power-sum proof uses the general disk argument with a different choice of centre and radii and a Cauchy estimate for higher derivatives."
  ]
